{"data": [{"author_id": "2009110487250948100", "created_at": "2026-11-07T11:00:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119022059971858474"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/wfyYStOib0", "end": 203, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/koccr8861/status/2119022059971858474/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118675387450634240", "start": 180, "url": "https://t.co/wfyYStOib0"}]}, "id": "2119022059971858474", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 228, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "산업구조분석#1-3 패키징: 칩을 다 찍어도 못 붙여서 못 팔았음, TSMC 넘친 주문은 ASE로 감\n\n지난 편 #1-2에서 AI 칩은 누가 설계하든 TSMC 공장으로 간다고 했음. 그런데 공장에서 칩을 찍었다고 끝이 아님. AI 칩 하나는 계산하는 칩과 HBM(고대역폭 메모리) 여러 개를 한 몸으로 붙여야 완성됨. 이 https://t.co/wfyYStOib0", "url": "https://x.com/koccr8861/status/2119022059971858474"}, {"author_id": "2072257736134590464", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:57:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118930735046504925"], "id": "2118930735046504925", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "If TSMC really moves into HBM, the memory trio should worry less about yield and more about bundling. TSMC already owns CoWoS. Logic + packaging + memory under one roof is a pitch Nvidia and AMD would love. Hype or real threat?", "url": "https://x.com/SYHTheLostSea/status/2118930735046504925"}, {"author_id": "2014257062889271296", "created_at": "2026-11-08T05:09:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119296336713711974"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 138, "start": 134, "tag": "TSM"}]}, "id": "2119296336713711974", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 75, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC doesn't need to manufacture DRAM cells to capture more value from HBM.\n\nThe reported 3D DRAM initiative remains unconfirmed. But $TSM  already has a more concrete role: advanced logic for HBM4 base dies and CoWoS packaging for AI accelerators.\n\nSK hynix has confirmed its", "url": "https://x.com/StragglerLiu/status/2119296336713711974"}, {"author_id": "2058302837587685378", "created_at": "2026-11-07T17:47:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119124656557011105"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 4, "start": 0, "tag": "TSM"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/rAXEYPGl86", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AuraConvexity/status/2119124656557011105/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119124531319070720", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/rAXEYPGl86"}]}, "id": "2119124656557011105", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 213, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$TSM denied the 3D DRAM rumor today.\n\nTom's Hardware, Nov 7: a TSMC spokesperson said the company \"focuses on our core business at all times, which is dedicated IC foundry\" and will remain the capacity provider \"of the global logic IC industry for years to come.\"\n\nThat answers https://t.co/rAXEYPGl86", "url": "https://x.com/AuraConvexity/status/2119124656557011105"}, {"author_id": "1543570961227988992", "created_at": "2026-11-07T03:10:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118903768758768016"], "id": "2118903768758768016", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 255, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 TSMC ĐANG NẮM GIỮ NÚT THẮT QUAN TRỌNG CỦA CƠN SỐT AI ĐÓNG GÓI CHIP\n\nKhi nhu cầu chip AI tăng mạnh, vấn đề không còn đơn giản là sản xuất được bao nhiêu con chip, mà còn là có đủ năng lực đóng gói chúng hay không.\n\nTSMC hiện giữ vai trò thống trị trong công", "url": "https://x.com/TobyNMT/status/2118903768758768016"}, {"author_id": "6611952", "created_at": "2026-11-06T23:40:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118850922453319969"], "id": "2118850922453319969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMCがNVIDIAからの要請を受け、先端メモリーの製造参入を検討していると報じられた。対象はセルを垂直方向へ積層する3D", "url": "https://x.com/got/status/2118850922453319969"}, {"author_id": "785856172209373184", "created_at": "2026-11-08T08:07:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119341141825102141"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8sRnNSKo9Q", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2119341141825102141/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119341138977214464", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/8sRnNSKo9Q"}]}, "id": "2119341141825102141", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 105, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Dossier IA/semi de la semaine (08–15 nov.) — catalyseurs à fort impact\n\n1) TSMC — ventes d’octobre attendues mardi 10/11 (AS/Taipei 13h30)\n\nTSMC publiera ses ventes mensuelles d’octobre le 10 novembre (13h30 à Taipei), baromètre direct des commandes 3/2 nm et du packaging CoWoS https://t.co/8sRnNSKo9Q", "url": "https://x.com/Rutowi_/status/2119341141825102141"}, {"author_id": "2095722313744601088", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:11:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118858732314783842"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/77M6EdLRja", "end": 168, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rennix7t/status/2118858732314783842/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118858719262052352", "start": 145, "url": "https://t.co/77M6EdLRja"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/77M6EdLRja", "end": 168, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rennix7t/status/2118858732314783842/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118858723280195584", "start": 145, "url": "https://t.co/77M6EdLRja"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/77M6EdLRja", "end": 168, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Rennix7t/status/2118858732314783842/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118858727025721344", "start": 145, "url": "https://t.co/77M6EdLRja"}]}, "id": "2118858732314783842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 176, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "台积电据悉考虑造3D DRAM，HBM合作伙伴可能迎来新对手\n\n0. 当前投资机会要点\n\n- 财联社北京时间2026年11月7日报道，台积电据悉考虑生产3D DRAM，正评估新建工厂或收购工厂后改造，量产时间未定。若落地，其业务将从逻辑代工、封装进一步延伸到存储制造，改变现有分工。\n\n- https://t.co/77M6EdLRja", "url": "https://x.com/Rennix7t/status/2118858732314783842"}, {"article": {"title": "The Non-Fungible Die: Custom HBM4 Base Dies, The 3x P/E Fallacy, and the End of the Memory Short"}, "author_id": "1600530338920415232", "created_at": "2026-11-07T00:45:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118867457205059673"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 247, "start": 244, "tag": "MU"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2118…", "end": 272, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2118445046701727744", "start": 249, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2118445046701727744", "url": "https://t.co/w2MyatrJVx"}]}, "id": "2118867457205059673", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 47, "impression_count": 8558, "like_count": 36, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "The Non-Fungible Die: Custom HBM4 Base Dies, The 3x P/E Fallacy &amp; The End of the Memory Short\n\nInstitutional Research | Monograph Vol. 09\n\nDeconstructing 3.5:1 cleanroom crowd-out, hostage silicon lock-in, and the 5.5x Davis Double Play on $MU. https://t.co/w2MyatrJVx", "url": "https://x.com/LiDaosen/status/2118867457205059673"}, {"article": {"title": "The Drifting Baseline Paradox: Why the MATCH Act Sealed Western Semiconductor Primacy"}, "author_id": "1600530338920415232", "created_at": "2026-11-07T03:35:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118910210664235086"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 258, "start": 253, "tag": "ASML"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2111…", "end": 283, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2111494258548977664", "start": 260, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2111494258548977664", "url": "https://t.co/K9lsxpQhdi"}]}, "id": "2118910210664235086", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1456, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Drifting Baseline Paradox: Why the MATCH Act Sealed Western Semiconductor Primacy\n\nInstitutional Tech Monograph #4 | Silicon &amp; Infra Alpha\n\nDeconstructing lithography escape velocity, wavefront metrology, and why commodity substitution fails in $ASML. https://t.co/K9lsxpQhdi", "url": "https://x.com/LiDaosen/status/2118910210664235086"}, {"author_id": "2072257736134590464", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:51:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118929380101755347"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/fQ2LRvGzCE", "end": 242, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SYHTheLostSea/status/2118929380101755347/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118929365396561920", "start": 219, "url": "https://t.co/fQ2LRvGzCE"}]}, "id": "2118929380101755347", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Everyone's arguing Nvidia vs custom ASICs. The real constraint for 2026–27 isn't the chip, it's HBM and advanced packaging. Whoever locks up memory and CoWoS-class capacity wins, regardless of whose logo is on the die. https://t.co/fQ2LRvGzCE", "url": "https://x.com/SYHTheLostSea/status/2118929380101755347"}, {"author_id": "1683281560890494976", "created_at": "2026-11-08T15:44:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119455972993188335"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/blueplanet223/…", "end": 213, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/blueplanet223/status/2119300726954594596", "start": 190, "url": "https://t.co/cbitNpp6ak"}]}, "id": "2119455972993188335", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 317, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119300726954594596", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Election ploy or not: Contract Manufacturing Rule #1 = De-risking the whale: TSMC dropping $60B+ a year in capex spend for 2nm and CoWoS. One customer at 60% CoWoS = too much concentration. https://t.co/cbitNpp6ak", "url": "https://x.com/donaldgorbachev/status/2119455972993188335"}, {"author_id": "1791161179189936128", "created_at": "2026-11-08T13:48:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119426839588290785"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 258, "start": 255, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 274, "start": 259, "tag": "Semiconductors"}, {"end": 282, "start": 275, "tag": "Nvidia"}]}, "id": "2119426839588290785", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "⚡️ New AI bottleneck: CoWoS chip packaging.\nTSMC capacity limits risk Nvidia &amp; AMD supplies. The fix: multi-billion dollar investments in partners (ASE Group) and multi-chip integration.\nAI speed now depends on assembly quality, not just core power. \n#AI #Semiconductors #Nvidia", "url": "https://x.com/anonimus666678/status/2119426839588290785"}, {"author_id": "1881240196756504576", "created_at": "2026-11-07T04:18:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118920885855719908"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/M2YCy4FD6N", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/semivision_tw/status/2118920885855719908/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118920883918045184", "start": 268, "url": "https://t.co/M2YCy4FD6N"}]}, "id": "2118920885855719908", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 2163, "like_count": 33, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Intel EMIB vs. TSMC CoWoS: Two Different Advanced Packaging Architectures\nAs high-performance computing and AI accelerators continue to evolve, traditional monolithic chip designs are increasingly constrained by die size, manufacturing economics, and memory bandwidth https://t.co/M2YCy4FD6N", "url": "https://x.com/semivision_tw/status/2118920885855719908"}, {"author_id": "1393846341223157763", "created_at": "2026-11-08T13:45:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119426085376913451"], "id": "2119426085376913451", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2066, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "AMD Venice是与INTEL XEON 7 (Diamond Rapids)相对应的产品.\n\nAMD Venice: “台积电 + 日月光/力成做 2.5D EFB 封装”:\n\nVenice  on 台积电（TSMC）：SoIC-X 与 CoWoS-L 已经发布量产并且产生营收.(AMD 首席执行官苏姿丰（Lisa Su）在 2026 年 11 月的财报电话会议上证实，“Venice”", "url": "https://x.com/harry03994688/status/2119426085376913451"}, {"author_id": "1653831727880478726", "created_at": "2026-11-08T12:42:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119410320816930946"], "id": "2119410320816930946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 190, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI chips are becoming packaging systems. TSMC lists 5.5-reticle-size CoWoS for 2026 volume production. Reuters (Nov. 6) reports packaging capacity remains a constraint. Watch qualified output and yields—not just transistor counts. NFA.", "url": "https://x.com/MegatrendMaster/status/2119410320816930946"}, {"author_id": "2098357851437641733", "created_at": "2026-11-08T20:00:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119520350559986143"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 54, "start": 49, "tag": "AVGO"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/frpX9QyNgC", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AtradianHQ/status/2119520350559986143/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119520346516692992", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/frpX9QyNgC"}]}, "id": "2119520350559986143", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Blackstone sees Anthropic at BB (junk) post-IPO. $AVGO reportedly guarantees ~$42B of its loans. TSMC may lift CoWoS prices up to 20%.\n\nThe AI funding story just became a credit story. Who carries the risk if the buyer is junk? Atradian Score on AVGO short: 60. A signal to https://t.co/frpX9QyNgC", "url": "https://x.com/AtradianHQ/status/2119520350559986143"}, {"author_id": "434684133", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:24:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119209394403750167"], "id": "2119209394403750167", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI芯片下一场竞争，可能不是谁能设计更强的GPU，而是谁能把芯片和HBM更快封装在一起。\n\n路透社调查指出，CoWoS及面板级封装正在成为GPU产业竞争焦点。Yole预测2026年先进封装收入将首次超过传统封装，相关资本开支接近280亿美元。台积电、日月光、力成及AMD、博通等参与扩产与技术布局。", "url": "https://x.com/ZhongRichard/status/2119209394403750167"}, {"author_id": "2091199668088717312", "created_at": "2026-11-08T16:56:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119474039072715134"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 67, "start": 63, "tag": "EUV"}, {"end": 145, "start": 141, "tag": "TSM"}, {"end": 159, "start": 154, "tag": "ASML"}, {"end": 181, "start": 176, "tag": "LRCX"}, {"end": 208, "start": 203, "tag": "AMAT"}, {"end": 228, "start": 224, "tag": "GLW"}], "hashtags": [{"end": 237, "start": 232, "tag": "ASML"}, {"end": 261, "start": 238, "tag": "SemiconductorEquipment"}, {"end": 266, "start": 262, "tag": "EUV"}, {"end": 279, "start": 267, "tag": "SupplyChain"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/rp3Mca8nxo", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/JeremySiegel_/status/2119474039072715134/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119474013986607105", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/rp3Mca8nxo"}]}, "id": "2119474039072715134", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Without advanced optics and equipment, chips cannot be made. 🔬 $EUV targets the foundational supply chain, featuring heavyweights like TSMC ($TSM), ASML ($ASML), Lam Research ($LRCX), Applied Materials ($AMAT), and Corning ($GLW).\n #ASML #SemiconductorEquipment #EUV #SupplyChain https://t.co/rp3Mca8nxo", "url": "https://x.com/JeremySiegel_/status/2119474039072715134"}, {"author_id": "380820651", "created_at": "2026-11-08T06:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119308938160251093"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Wj1PE7iLH4", "end": 174, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2119308938160251093/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118355149542621184", "start": 151, "url": "https://t.co/Wj1PE7iLH4"}, {"display_url": "x.com/QQ_Timmy/statu…", "end": 198, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2118325960978071625", "start": 175, "url": "https://t.co/fxp6VI9UqB"}]}, "id": "2119308938160251093", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 1958, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118325960978071625", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "大家以為 HBM 跟先進封裝卡在機台、基板，化學品不是瓶頸。\n\n不是這回事。JX金屬剛宣布：高純硫酸銅「ユピノーグ」產能，較 2026 年度上半期加約五成；新線在茨城日立，2027 年度下半期起依序投產。官方點名用途——先進封裝與 HBM 用的高品質銅鍍材料。\n\n一行帳：五成擴產，最早也要 2027 https://t.co/Wj1PE7iLH4 https://t.co/fxp6VI9UqB", "url": "https://x.com/Leoskie_L/status/2119308938160251093"}, {"author_id": "1128909671014604801", "created_at": "2026-11-08T19:35:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119514104746627211"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/1wTPbXbGjb", "end": 201, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/King_James_Kim/status/2119514104746627211/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119514094009303040", "start": 178, "url": "https://t.co/1wTPbXbGjb"}]}, "id": "2119514104746627211", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 102, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"반도체 웨이퍼 단 한 장의 가격이 3만 달러(약 4,100만 원). 3나노 대비 하루아침에 50%가 폭등했습니다. 그런데도 2028년까지 주문이 전량 매진됐습니다. TSMC의 세상입니다.\"\n\n⚡ TSMC 2나노 독점과 반도체 수율의 경제학 4대 팩트\n\n1️⃣ 20년 만에 가장 가파른 단일 노드 인상 (+50%)\n• https://t.co/1wTPbXbGjb", "url": "https://x.com/King_James_Kim/status/2119514104746627211"}, {"author_id": "146108201", "created_at": "2026-11-07T14:49:21.00